[SUBTITLE] THE SIX AGENTS OF NORILSK (2026):
[TEXT] 'In early 2026, six operatives were deployed across the city.'
[TEXT] 'Each found a terminal—hidden in subway stations, abandoned'
[TEXT] 'apartments, and old Soviet-era telecom hubs. Each connected'
[TEXT] 'to VNET at the same moment. Their mission: locate the 8 keys'
[TEXT] 'scattered across the network, decrypt the master terminal,'
[TEXT] 'and uncover what really happened at Site 9-B in 2014.'
[TEXT] 'One of them was a former VektraPay network administrator.'
[TEXT] 'One had access to the morgue records of Subject 409-B.'
[TEXT] 'One was a cult member who had decoded the Old Net fragments.'
[TEXT] 'They didn't know each other. They were just six strangers'
[TEXT] 'who found the same door. And walked through it.'
[BLOOD] 'The corporation thought they buried the truth in the permafrost.'
[PULSE] 'They forgot that the truth has a frequency. And it resonates.'
[GLITCH] 'Site 9-B is not sealed. It is waiting. For someone to listen.'
